Comment (internal/api/handler/workflows/import.go:202):
**Message overstates success and is self-contradictory on partial failure.**

`workflowImportMessage` builds `"imported %d definition(s)"` from `definitions` (the *input* count = `len(definitions)`), independent of how many actually succeeded. With one failure the user sees `"imported 21 definition(s), 1 failed"` — and on an all-failed file, `"imported 21 definition(s), 21 failed"` with 0 actually written. Please derive the count from `summary.DefinitionsCreated + summary.DefinitionsUpdated` so the message reflects what was persisted.
